  "prefLabel": "He-A 706.06 Termination of Service",
  "priorExpiration": "2006-11-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 706.06 Termination of Service. If an IDIP or WIDIP terminates its services to its designated catchment area(s) for any reason, the provider shall submit written notification of the termination to the department, and the catchment area(s) shall be reassigned by the commissioner for the remainder of the approval period.\n\nSource. #6653, EMERGENCY, eff 12-12-97, EXPIRED 4-11-98\n\nNew. #6753, eff 5-20-98; ss by #8624, INTERIM, eff 5-20-06, EXPIRES: 11-16-06; ss by #8749, eff 11-16-06",
